            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "A suggested sample webapp and documentation, along with a maven project to build the docs and webapp.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markds75",
            "name": "markds75",
            "key": "markds75",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Slater",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2006-02-15T20:13:07.000+0000",
          "updated": "2006-02-15T20:13:07.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12329000/comment/12366580",
          "id": "12366580",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markds75",
            "name": "markds75",
            "key": "markds75",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Slater",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "I just configured another system to use jackrabbit for the first time and left out the JAAS configuration. I installed the webapp and it ran without any problems... no security exceptions or anything else. I'm thinking of taking the JAAS section out of the docs for the test app since they don't seem to be needed; I think simplicity is key for getting people up and running with a repository to play with.\n\nAt the same time, the JSR 170 spec says very little about how security works inside a JCR repository, and Jackrabbit's documentation on the subject is also rather sparse. I'm not sure if the webapp *should* be working without the jaas.config file and associated JAVA_OPTS environment in place.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markds75",
            "name": "markds75",
            "key": "markds75",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Slater",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2006-02-16T11:01:20.000+0000",
          "updated": "2006-02-16T11:01:20.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12329000/comment/12366692",
          "id": "12366692",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=markds75",
            "name": "markds75",
            "key": "markds75",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Mark Slater",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "Fixed a bug in the code and removed my original package hierarchy (it was empty anyway). The documentation hasn't changed.",
